msgid "infoView/description"
msgstr ""
"Pull up a chair and join our board game! Choose one of three paper tanks and"
" fight for gifts on a snowy map across three Chapters from "
"%(whiteSpanish_Open)s%(startDate)s%(whiteSpanish_Close)s through "
"%(whiteSpanish_Open)s%(endDate)s%(whiteSpanish_Close)s. Collect Gift Coins "
"to speed up your progress on the board and pick up tons of rewards until the"
" event ends on %(whiteSpanish_Open)s%(progressDate)s%(whiteSpanish_Close)s."

